{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cereal Reaper is a singleplayer game where a cereal addicted freak runs out of cereal and does whatever it takes to get more. Find goofy characters on your journey and beat people up on your way to try to find the greatest breakfast ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo includes at least 30 minutes of content for you to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DEMO Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At least 30 minutes of EPIC gameplay!!!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Talk to people and read! (reading is good)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect cool stuff that make numbers go up!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your own style of combat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find secrets! (not very many)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover hidden game mechanics that the programmer forgot to explain in the game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beat the game faster than other people with the speedrun timer feature and the fast paced game mechanics designed just for this purpose!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(There are no leaderboards for speedrun times inside the game.)</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Washed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3566460/886b2e4c0107057b5797dd4beae144d92834ca57.jpg"},{"name":" Thank You","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3566460/a699502fdda04d85d4d50f187c3b072ed0c64d5c.jpg"},{"name":"The Mind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3566460/3e9f999f598a796abdd182ee567b061b40090f1d.jpg"},{"name":"Gnomed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3566460/cd35563df8d394c522388fa97a12f0bccb891aed.jpg"},{"name":"Paper Boy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3566460/741f94d011df8